67,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMWHL4w","user":{"login":"amenhany","id":179514017,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrMqoQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179514017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany","html_url":"https://github.com/amenhany","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T21:17:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T21:17:16Z","body":"You raise valid points and it is up to the maintainers at the end of the day. But the same could be said about the tooltip for other cells that also show the same content that is already visible, and is mostly for truncated text. I guess the expected design for most UI is for the tooltip to show the content of the cell whereas showing the whole list is weirder behavior whilst not necessarily worse, but could be worse for longer lists which would make the tooltip obtrusive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5123460067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5123596843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121911#issuecomment-5123596843","issue_url"